# Operation Teatime (ahtUrhgan): Iruki-Waraki in Whitegate, Dnegan in Nashmau, Caedarva Mire's qm10. A PUP of level 50
# (AF2_QUEST_LEVEL) with No Strings Attached and The Wayward Automaton completed (GMs) and the Animator held. Iruki-
# Waraki answers No Strings Attached's 267 first, his script on the next talk (UseFallback; see The Wayward
# Automaton's flow). His script: no Wayward arm (a PUP of 50, completed), not his 267 arm (a PUP); this quest's 778
# (finish: OperationTeaTimeProgress 1, begun); 779 at 1. The trade of a Flask of Sleeping Potion and a Cup of Chai at
# 1: 780 (finish: OperationTeaTimeProgress 2, the trade confirmed: both taken); 781 at 2. Dnegan reads
# OperationTeatimeProgress (small t) and sees Iruki-Waraki's 2: a char var's name is matched without case (the row
# keeps the spelling it was made with, OperationTeaTimeProgress, through every later write). 290, option 0:
# OTT_DayWait today; the same day: 288; `wait vana=24` (the next Vana'diel day): 290, option 1:
# OperationTeatimeProgress 3, OTT_DayWait 0. Iruki-Waraki at 3: no script arm (his 267 again), and a second potion and chai
# traded: nothing. qm10 at 3: 15; its finish with a full inventory: the completion fails (the Puppetry Churidars do
# not fit); with room: the churidars, completed, OperationTeatimeProgress cleared; then NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY.
char zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=102.8,-6.0,-29.0 job=PUP lvl=50
quest AhtUrhgan.NoStringsAttached completed
quest AhtUrhgan.TheWaywardAutomaton completed
item Animator
item FlaskOfSleepingPotion x2
item CupOfChai x2
login
trigger Iruki-Waraki                    # No Strings Attached's 267 (UseFallback 0)
finish
trigger Iruki-Waraki                    # the script: no Wayward arm; this quest available: 778
finish                                  # OperationTeaTimeProgress 1; begun
trigger Iruki-Waraki                    # 267
finish
trigger Iruki-Waraki                    # accepted, OperationTeaTimeProgress 1: 779
finish
trade Iruki-Waraki FlaskOfSleepingPotion x1  # the potion alone: nothing (npcUtil.tradeHas wants both)
trade Iruki-Waraki FlaskOfSleepingPotion x1 CupOfChai x1  # both, OperationTeaTimeProgress 1: 780
finish                                  # OperationTeaTimeProgress 2; the potion and the chai taken
trigger Iruki-Waraki                    # 267
finish
trigger Iruki-Waraki                    # OperationTeaTimeProgress 2: 781
finish
warp 31.0,-6.0,56.0 Nashmau
trigger Dnegan                          # OperationTeatimeProgress 2 (Iruki-Waraki's), OTT_DayWait not today: 290
finish option=0                         # OTT_DayWait today
trigger Dnegan                          # OTT_DayWait today: no arm: his 288
finish
wait vana=24                            # the next Vana'diel day
trigger Dnegan                          # OTT_DayWait yesterday: 290
finish option=1                         # OperationTeatimeProgress 3; OTT_DayWait 0
warp 102.8,-6.0,-29.0 AhtUrhganWhitegate
trigger Iruki-Waraki                    # 267 (the warp cleared UseFallback)
finish
trigger Iruki-Waraki                    # the script at progress 3: no arm (781 wants 2): the lookup's 267
finish
trade Iruki-Waraki FlaskOfSleepingPotion x1 CupOfChai x1  # a second set at progress 3: nothing (the trade wants 1)
warp 474.8,-31.8,75.5 CaedarvaMire
trigger qm10                            # accepted, OperationTeatimeProgress 3: 15
fill-inventory
finish                                  # no room for the churidars: not completed
free-inventory
trigger qm10                            # 15
finish                                  # the Puppetry Churidars; completed; OperationTeatimeProgress cleared
trigger qm10                            # completed: NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY
